00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.850
but also the use
of psychedelics.

00:04:15.850 --> 00:04:18.519
And we discussed Sam's
experiences with psychedelics

00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:21.100
as they relate to expanding
one's consciousness.

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:23.740
I also asked Sam about
his views and practices

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:25.390
related to social media.

00:04:25.390 --> 00:04:29.110
Prompted in no small part by
his recent voluntary decision

00:04:29.110 --> 00:04:31.060
